{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>陳奕迅（Eason）將於香港演藝學院舉行26場公開錄音騷《Recording Sessions with Mr. Eason Chan》，以抽籤形式售票，中籤結果早前已出爐，不少人都惋惜自己沒有中籤。有抽票成功的網民在Threads放售門票，開價高達1.7萬港元，連英皇男歌手曾傲棐都忍不住留言爆粗。</p><figure><img alt=\"陳奕迅（Eason）將於香港演藝學院舉行26場公開錄音騷《Recording Sessions with Mr. Eason Chan》。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240617/879394862808436736864025.jpeg/g0_7st6p28aigTqxxg45h--WNNbTZB3L3j4A_t4-AP4\"/><figcaption>陳奕迅（Eason）將於香港演藝學院舉行26場公開錄音騷《Recording Sessions with Mr. Eason Chan》。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Eason演唱會一票難求。(IG@mreasonchan)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240830/906032790527545344428950.jpeg/pAVv6PpMDfV8UfQfjvXWB2O5dsmBuw3XJ_iOvCf4jrw\"/><figcaption>Eason演唱會一票難求。(IG@mreasonchan)</figcaption></figure><p>陳奕迅演唱會名額黃牛價高達1.7萬港元</p><p>日前有網民在Threads上載一張首輪抽籤成功的截圖，並發文：「放 eason 首輪購票名額2個/$17K 爽快可議 麻煩pm」，兩個名額共叫價1.7萬港元，平均每個名額為8,500元，遠超980元及1,280元官方票價。而英皇男歌手曾傲棐（Arvin）在該則帖文下留言「dnlm」，至今獲得逾7000讚好。</p><p>陳奕迅26場演唱會公開登記抽籤購票總數直逼500萬大關</p><p>陳奕迅早前宣布將於香港演藝學院舉行合共26場《Recording Sessions with Mr. Eason Chan 與陳奕迅一起錄音》，一連兩日公開登記抽籤購票總數直逼500萬大關，被歌迷笑言「難中過六合彩」。因應需求甚殷，大會早前呼籲歌迷切勿輕信黃牛或來歷不明門票，以免招致金錢損失，透露已就相關可疑售票活動向警方報案備案，並會持續密切監察市場情況。</p><figure><img alt=\"有網民以1.7萬港元放售Eason演唱會兩個名額。（Threads圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194648763139362816890375.png/cqrKUkALUguA42hizH8-QiA3f4pLDgW-2NmHH9jZhx8\"/><figcaption>有網民以1.7萬港元放售Eason演唱會兩個名額。（Threads圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"英皇歌手曾傲棐爆粗留言。（Threads圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194648760807198720704381.jpeg/0KsVBp22dNRHKBWxBP75ZVHjg2NthoGKK6E_6yuhP-s\"/><figcaption>英皇歌手曾傲棐爆粗留言。（Threads圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"英皇歌手曾傲棐爆粗留言。（Threads圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194648758487617536140932.jpeg/HVNLIIxsoQwJgy_UA1lTmEGp32rx99YJh7m0sIe5tLA\"/><figcaption>英皇歌手曾傲棐爆粗留言。（Threads圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"帖文掀起網民熱議。（Threads圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194648756205785088643807.jpeg/fg1l_q6Opc4tKDiPwCs8WRMzgZwqnLJJy0SsS8tErEs\"/><figcaption>帖文掀起網民熱議。（Threads圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不少網民直斥過份。（Threads圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194648753894592512836274.jpeg/8Bk5t2Z5SbaLN6DH8frVF-qjBNE_bA0ooT8j4qE_I-I\"/><figcaption>不少網民直斥過份。（Threads圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"曾傲棐（Arvin）是英皇歌手。（公關提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260816/1165718945953484800624803.jpeg/dDMmxc-CzzNNtM5vYHAQ38WK__h-0-DXwqd_l8Knf5c\"/><figcaption>曾傲棐（Arvin）是英皇歌手。（公關提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"曾傲棐爆粗留言。（官方提供圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260814/1165052453826072576610845.jpeg/Omla0IxiCgCAVtUgKuWi6osuGxnG0dzIx4Vgi8eFYIs\"/><figcaption>曾傲棐爆粗留言。（官方提供圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T16:45:49.750161+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":801,"images":9,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T15:45:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T18:14:42.969886+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T16:38:50.717881+00:00","content_hash":"02d6ce7d2ad89f7076d224f33eb5f45bca0b2c630dc37d446adb435d14531648","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}